OL,3,GNEWSAFuneral for second officer killed
OL,4,Ain A66 crash to be held
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe funeral for the second police
OL,7,Fofficer killed in a wrong-way crash
OL,8,Fwhile on duty will take place later on
OL,9,FThursday.
OL,11,FPC Tom Clough, 38, died on the A66 in
OL,12,FSouth Bank, near Middlesbrough, in the
OL,13,Fearly hours of 22 August alongside his
OL,14,Fcolleague PC Matthew Blades when a
OL,15,FVolkswagon Passat collided with their
OL,16,Fmarked armed police car. The five young
OL,17,Fmen in the Passat also died.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
