OL,3,GNEWSAFuneral for second officer killed
OL,4,Ain A66 crash to be held
OL,5,
OL,6,FPC Blades' funeral took place in
OL,7,FHartlepool on Wednesday with hundreds
OL,8,Fof police officers from around the
OL,9,Fcountry and members of the community
OL,10,Flining the street.
OL,12,FCleveland Police Federation chair
OL,13,FLauren Somerville said PC Clough's
OL,14,Fpartner had said public support
OL,15,F"brought them so much strength".
